        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mallory Hagan, Alexis Wineman\n- Events: Miss America 2013, Miss New York 2012\n- Places: PH Live, Las Vegas Strip, Paradise, Nevada\n- Topics: beauty pageants, autism representation\n\nFacts:\n- Mallory Hytes Hagan was born on December 23, 1988.\n- Mallory Hytes Hagan is an American actress, model, and beauty queen.\n- Mallory Hytes Hagan won Miss New York 2012.\n- On January 12, 2013, Miss America 2013, the 86th Miss America pageant, was held at PH Live on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada.\n- Mallory Hytes Hagan won Miss America 2013.\n- At the Miss America 2013 pageant, Alexis Wineman won the \"America's Choice\" award.\n- Alexis Wineman was the first known autistic contestant to compete in the Miss America pageant.",
